# Test executables that `make check` produces but nothing ignored (2026-08-20).
# These 23 were swept into a commit by a `git add -A` and had to be removed
# again. `test_modules/main` was already listed; its siblings were not.
#
# REPO HYGIENE NOTE: 542 test executables ARE tracked in this repository, and
# every compiler change rebuilds them, so any `git add -A` produces hundreds of
# binary diffs that bury the source change. Untracking them is an owner call
# (`git rm --cached` over the set + a pattern rule here); this section only
# stops the set from growing.
examples/cve-demos/baron_samedit_safe
examples/cve-demos/heartbleed_safe
test_modules/app
test_modules/collision_test
test_modules/comptime_user
test_modules/cross_handle
test_modules/defer_deep_user
test_modules/defer_user
test_modules/diamond
test_modules/diamond2
test_modules/enum_user
test_modules/gcoll
test_modules/handle_user
